    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRUSH YOUR OPPONENTS AND BE THE MASTER OF THE ARENA! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall The Ball is a fun 2D party game played from 2 to 4 players in which victory is all that matters! A giant ball is in the arena, your goal: send it to your opponents! Get the most points before the time runs out and dominate the competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AN UNCONTROLLABLE BALL!</u></strong><u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball only bounces around the edges of the arena and never stops! The more you hit it, the faster it will go! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PLAY CRAZY CHARACTERS : THE DEMINIS !</u></strong><u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you prefer brute force, magic or a car? That, we let you decide. What is certain is that each Demini have their own abilities!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRUSH YOUR OPPONENTS AND BE THE MASTER OF THE ARENA! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall The Ball is a fun 2D party game played from 2 to 4 players in which victory is all that matters! A giant ball is in the arena, your goal: send it to your opponents! Get the most points before the time runs out and dominate the competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AN UNCONTROLLABLE BALL!</u></strong><u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball only bounces around the edges of the arena and never stops! The more you hit it, the faster it will go! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PLAY CRAZY CHARACTERS : THE DEMINIS !</u></strong><u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you prefer brute force, magic or a car? That, we let you decide. What is certain is that each Demini have their own abilities!</p>",
